{"text":"安定王為女夫閭散騎故□入法，敬造觀世音像二軀。聖教暐，真相景發，妙極天華，含生仰化。願使閭散騎緣此入法之功，當令永離塵軀，即真無礙，開朗玄門，常為龍華唱首。又願緣眷萬善歸祐，吉祥徵集。一切群生，咸同茲願。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"入法","refId":null,"text":"入法","start":11,"end":13},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"觀世音","refId":null,"text":"觀世音","start":16,"end":19},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":37,"end":39},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"入法","refId":null,"text":"入法","start":49,"end":51},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無礙","refId":null,"text":"無礙","start":63,"end":65},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"龍華","start":73,"end":75},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"群生","start":94,"end":96}]}